<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-13T07:53:43.104Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:53:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative planning attacks for Iran near the Lebanon border, while Houthi forces attacked Riyadh's King Khalid Airport, killing 12 and injuring 309. Syrian security forces intensified anti-ISIS operations, pursued former regime loyalists, and engaged private security firms linked to a new Syrian security mogul, while also foiling drug-smuggling attempts on the Iraq and Jordan borders. The UN Security Council discussed the situation, urging Israel to respect the 1974 Disengagement Agreement and calling for an end to Israeli incursions into southern Syria. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPOXI2TTZqRGFFcm9NZV9uTktESzkwZ2VQWWg3My1aTWZVRy1OSnUycVB5ZGJZMUNiYlRKN1VpcDlfaS1jVHRKQ3hha1d1RVlKdF81eGRUV3lzUFgyLWo4MmdxUVFlQU5vQklaZzRRUDVNZUlKNF9pcGttYXJQNmc4VTRabzdPVzcwbzU4azJoaHJuVmZYVmFUTXJ4cmQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jordan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOZmpNUVpTczlzVGQ4T01majJFZ1h1ZXN0T1J0ZWFzWkZVWVFoVFczNllCcjNKY3FSUi1NREpxdXpidDJkTUM3d1k4QzI5R044WVVXR0lGV1FmcEJ5SHhjVVk2Q3V5Ql80WHRBcS1xUHl5a19VMlVTazRWXzR1ajJ6SWo5N0Q4YkZZOFpaV1JUd3dXYnlmWW9iZWRwZ0dmQU45bGUweExKVXJNYmNlNnYyWW5mMVF2Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPcUc4Ykw1VjJOUjJCUmlDZHJ5dmpSR3BWcnZZOEF0T1cteGlQY1dOOUpYZXF0TEJmS3N6SkJUOHhJS0xqWEJYczdhYWZmN25uR19uVnFQMFRuS3hrbkN1Y3o1ZW9JSHRscHlYXzNiR2hCQWR3WkhKTENlY2owdGFOTTVLNE9pUjhFUWtfVDVpS2ExRkt1am5zMEZyRzl4U0dGUlYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Türkiye To